# LeakSanitizer's suppressions for the viewer on a desktop session's display (viewer_program_test.py
# passes them only then; under Xvfb nothing leaks). On Wayland, GLFW allocates some of the window's
# Wayland objects without freeing them, and the window's title bar, drawn through libdecor's GTK
# plugin, leaves fontconfig's patterns behind: system libraries' memory, none of it Fillscope's.
leak:_glfwCreateWindowWayland
leak:libfontconfig.so
